SUMMARY:CoreStory + GitHub Copilot: Turning Plausible Suggestions Into Cor
 rect Ones
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nGitHub Copilot is powerful\, but it
 s effectiveness depends on context. By connecting CoreStory to Copilot thr
 ough MCP\, developers give Copilot persistent intelligence about their cod
 ebase\, architecture\, dependencies\, and business logic.\nThe result: mor
 e accurate suggestions\, fewer hallucinations\, fewer regressions\, and co
 de that works the first time.\nJoin us for a live demo showing how CoreSto
 ry helps Copilot deliver smarter\, more trustworthy results\, and why team
 s have seen up to 44% better task resolution when AI agents work from Core
 Story’s intelligence.\n\nSeries Info - https://aka.ms/StartupSpotlight/S
 -1443\n\n[EventID:27459]
