SUMMARY:Secure and Govern Agents\, MCP Servers\, and AI Tools with AI Gate
 way
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nAs organizations move from AI appli
 cations to autonomous agents\, governance must extend beyond models to the
  tools\, APIs\, and data agents can access. Learn how AI Gateway helps org
 anizations publish and govern MCP servers\, secure agent-to-tool interacti
 ons\, enforce runtime policies\, and gain visibility into agent activity. 
 See how to establish trusted access to enterprise systems for agents while
  maintaining security\, compliance\, and operational control across your A
 I ecosystem.\n\n[App Service documentation](https://learn.microsoft.com/az
 ure/app-service/?wt.mc_id=meetup_27397_webpage_reactor)\n[Explore the Buil
 d Cloud Native Apps series](https://developer.microsoft.com/reactor/series
 /S-1692?wt.mc_id=meetup_27397_webpage_reactor)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3157
 95276/
