SUMMARY:Model Mondays - Spotlight On Claude Models
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nClaude models are designed for comp
 lex reasoning\, coding\, and multimodal tasks\, giving developers flexible
  options for building agents that need to understand context and handle so
 phisticated workflows.\n\nJoin us as we explore the Claude family in Micro
 soft Foundry and see how these models can be evaluated and used to build m
 ore capable AI agents.\n\n* [Explore the Resources](https://github.com/mic
 rosoft/model-mondays)\n* [Read the Newsletter](https://aka.ms/model-monday
 s/newsletter)\n* [Continue the conversation on the Discord](https://aka.ms
 /model-mondays/discord)\n\n[eventID:27542]
