SUMMARY:Finalists Revealed: What a Winning Power BI Dataviz Looks Like
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThese are the names to remember. Th
 ey’re headed to the finals.\n\nMeet the Power BI Dataviz competition fin
 alists and take a closer look at the work that earned them a spot on the g
 lobal stage. You’ll see how they approached the challenge\, what made th
 eir visuals stand out\, and how they turned ideas into something that rise
 s above the rest.\n\nThey’re headed to Barcelona to compete live on stag
 e at FabCon. They’ll have 20 minutes (that’s 1\,200 seconds) to create
  a world-class visual in front of a cheering audience. When it’s over\, 
 only one person can call themselves the Power BI Dataviz World Champion.\n
 \nPick your favorite and join their virtual cheer squad before they hit th
 e stage.
